        },
        {
          "text": "Na kuli muntu naba omwe mucete akati kababunyina, mumunzi nuuba omwe munyika Jehova Leza wanu njayoomupa, mutayumyi myoyo yanu nekuba kuvunga maanza aanu kubanyoko bacete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
