        },
        {
          "text": "Amucenjele kuti mutabi miyeeyo ya-Sataani mumyoyo yanu, Mutaambi kuti, Mwaka wamusanu aibili, mwaka walwaangunuko, uli afwaafwi, Mutafwi mulibu, mutakaki kupa beenzinyoko bacete cintu. Na mwacita obo, ambweni balakwiilila Jehova nkaambo kanu, aboobo uyooba amulandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.9",
