        {
          "text": "Ncobeni muleelede kubapa, alimwi myoyo yanu tiielede kupa bufutete pe, nkaambo kakuti makani aya ngengao Jehova Leza wanu ngayoomupeda coolwe mumilimo yanu yoonse amuzintu zyoonse nzemucita. ",
          "type": "text",
