          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bweza insunda, udonkole kutwi kwakwe cakusyanikizya acitendele, elyo ulaba muzike wako lyoonse. Amulanda wako musimbi alakwe acitilwe mbubonya obo. ",
          "type": "text",
