                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Citabi cintu ciyumu mumeso aako kumwaangununa, pe, nkaambo wakubelekela milimo myaka iili musanu aumwi, alimwi milimo yakwe waibbadela cisela buyo camali aamilimo yamulanda uuvola mali. Aboobo Jehova Leza wanu ulamupa coolwe mumilimo yoonse njemucita.",
          "type": "text",
